  "en": {
    "title": "seq - Print a range of integers",
    "synopsis": "seq [first] last",
    "description": "Prints one integer per line, counting up or down. It is the only generator a pipeline has.",
    "details": "NAME\n  seq - Print a range of integers\n\nSYNOPSIS\n  seq [first] last\n\nDESCRIPTION\n  Prints one integer per line, counting up or down. It is the only generator a pipeline has.\n\nOPTIONS\n  first\n    Where to start (1 by default).\n  last\n    Where to stop; counts down when it is smaller than first.\n\nDEVICE COST\n  None. Entirely browser-side.\n\nSEE ALSO\n  sort(1), uniq(1)\n\nEXAMPLES\n  seq 5\n  seq 10 1"
  }
